cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "osquery-steamvr-frame-timing: a steamvr_frame_timing table for osquery"
abstract: >
  An osquery extension that adds a steamvr_frame_timing table: the SteamVR
  compositor's frame rate, frame time, dropped and reprojected frames, read
  through the OpenVR API from outside the game.
authors:
